WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.727
Method chaining lets us read a workflow from top to bottom.

00:00:03.727 --> 00:00:07.907
The orders DataFrame contains channel and amount.

00:00:07.907 --> 00:00:14.407
Assign creates a Boolean column called large_order using a threshold of seventy.

00:00:14.407 --> 00:00:21.558
Groupby then groups rows by channel, and agg calculates total amount and the number of large orders.

00:00:22.190 --> 00:00:26.257
Notice how each step produces the table used by the next step.

00:00:26.257 --> 00:00:32.292
The parentheses let us spread the chain across several lines so it stays readable.

00:00:32.292 --> 00:00:37.386
Try changing the large-order threshold and see how the summary changes.
